// returns, what hooks walk and change, and what render.ae draws with vg.
//
// Ported from Chartist v2.0.0 (github.com/chartist-js/chartist, commit
// cf181279cf60a9c89cc0b19bb05e82b48f9ebcdf), maintained in Aether from here on.
